#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "Q1LbhS"
msgid "New career"
msgstr "Nowy zawód"

#. {goal} is an example goal like “become a data analyst in 6 months”; <quote> puts your language's quote marks around it. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Diga aonde quer chegar, como <quote>{goal}</quote>. O plano vai do básico às ferramentas da área e pula o que você já sabe.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "a5TSiQ"
msgid "Say where you want to get, like <quote>{goal}</quote>. Your plan goes from the basics to the tools of the field and skips what you already know."
msgstr "Powiedz, co chcesz osiągnąć, na przykład <quote>{goal}</quote>. Twój plan prowadzi od podstaw do narzędzi używanych w branży i pomija to, co już wiesz."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Para mudar de área, o que estudar e em que ordem.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/career-section.tsx
msgctxt "O5V56t"
msgid "Changing careers? What to study, and in what order."
msgstr "Zmiana zawodu? Czego się uczyć i w jakiej kolejności."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Todo plano funciona assim”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/every-plan.tsx
msgctxt "UMn7XD"
