msgstr "{time} dziennie"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Qual é o seu objetivo?”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/final-call.tsx
msgctxt "AaFZIp"
msgid "What's your goal?"
msgstr "Jaki masz cel?"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Conte do seu jeito e responda umas perguntas rápidas. Depois, é só seguir o plano de cada dia.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/final-call.tsx
msgctxt "8-G4l1"
msgid "Tell us in your own words and answer a few quick questions. Then just follow each day's plan."
msgstr "Opowiedz o nim własnymi słowami i odpowiedz na kilka krótkich pytań. Potem wystarczy trzymać się planu na każdy dzień."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "RsvuP8"
msgid "Yes. You start free, no account needed. A free account gives you {lessons, plural, one {# lesson} other {# lessons}} a month across all your goals, exams included, with {goals, plural, one {one goal} other {up to # goals}} at a time. No card needed."
msgstr "Tak. Zaczynasz bezpłatnie, bez konta. Na bezpłatnym koncie dostajesz {lessons, plural, one {# lekcję} few {# lekcje} other {# lekcji}} miesięcznie na wszystkie cele łącznie, w tym egzaminy, i możesz mieć {goals, plural, one {jeden cel} other {do # celów}} naraz. Nie potrzebujesz karty."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "NNtrw6"
msgid "Is Zoonk free?"
msgstr "Czy Zoonk jest bezpłatny?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "FeMMSb"
msgid "Every lesson and every goal, with no monthly limit. For an exam, that's your whole plan up to exam day, with mock exams timed like the real one. You also get help whenever you're stuck and more speaking practice. You see your whole plan before you pay, and you can cancel anytime."
msgstr "Wszystkie lekcje i cele, bez miesięcznego limitu. Jeśli przygotowujesz się do egzaminu, dostajesz cały plan aż do dnia egzaminu oraz egzaminy próbne z takim samym limitem czasu jak na właściwym egzaminie. Dostajesz też pomoc, gdy utkniesz, i więcej okazji do ćwiczenia mówienia. Cały plan widzisz przed zapłatą i możesz zrezygnować w dowolnej chwili."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
#: src/components/public/start-free-note.tsx
msgctxt "iES0bT"
msgid "See prices"
msgstr "Zobacz ceny"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "tk_pDR"
msgid "What do I get if I subscribe?"
msgstr "Co dostanę w ramach subskrypcji?"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “As aulas são criadas com os modelos de IA mais recentes e conferidas antes de chegar até você: a gente testa a qualidade com várias avaliações, e outros modelos revisam o conteúdo. Elas seguem as matérias e os tópicos da sua prova. Erros são raros, mas podem acontecer. Viu algo errado? Avise a gente pela própria aula e vamos conferir.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "yyFZMH"
msgid "Lessons are made with the latest AI models and checked before they reach you: we test their quality with several evaluations, and other models review the content. They follow your exam's subjects and topics. Mistakes are rare, but they can happen. See something wrong? Tell us from the lesson and we'll look into it."
msgstr "Tworzymy lekcje z pomocą najnowszych modeli AI i sprawdzamy je, zanim do ciebie trafią: oceniamy ich jakość w kilku testach, a inne modele sprawdzają treść. Obejmują przedmioty i tematy z twojego egzaminu. Błędy zdarzają się rzadko, ale są możliwe. Coś się nie zgadza? Zgłoś to bezpośrednio w lekcji, a my to sprawdzimy."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Dá para confiar em aulas criadas por IA?”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "kf3mxX"
msgid "Can you trust lessons made by AI?"
msgstr "Czy można ufać lekcjom tworzonym przez AI?"

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Os apps para iPhone e Android estão chegando. Por enquanto, o Zoonk funciona no navegador do celular e do computador, sem instalar nada.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "LCjwHc"
msgid "The iPhone and Android apps are coming soon. For now, Zoonk works in your phone's or computer's browser, with nothing to install."
msgstr "Aplikacje na telefony iPhone i urządzenia z systemem Android pojawią się wkrótce. Na razie Zoonk działa w przeglądarce na telefonie lub komputerze. Niczego nie musisz instalować."

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "xHun-9"
msgid "Is there an app?"
msgstr "Czy jest aplikacja?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "sD9IL-"
msgid "What's left comes first the next day. If a date changes, your plan tells you. You can also change how long you study each day whenever you want."
msgstr "To, co zostanie, będzie pierwsze w planie na następny dzień. Jeśli zmieni się jakaś data, plan cię o tym poinformuje. W każdej chwili możesz też zmienić dzienny czas nauki."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “E se eu faltar um dia?”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "Jd18jf"
msgid "What if I miss a day?"
msgstr "Co, jeśli opuszczę dzień nauki?"

#. {exams} lists exams people in your country study for, ending with a school test, such as “concurso, Enem, OAB, vestibular ou prova da escola”. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Qualquer prova, como concurso, Enem, OAB, vestibular ou prova da escola. Também idiomas, uma nova carreira ou qualquer assunto que você queira aprender. Escreva seu objetivo do seu jeito.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "r4pGG1"
msgid "Any exam, such as {exams}. Also languages, a new career or any topic you want to learn. Write your goal in your own words."
msgstr "Każdy egzamin, na przykład {exams}. A także języki, nowy zawód lub dowolny temat, który chcesz poznać. Opisz swój cel własnymi słowami."

#. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Quais provas e objetivos dá para estudar?”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "iJ_ZyQ"
msgid "Which exams and goals can I study for?"
msgstr "Do jakich egzaminów mogę się przygotować i jakie cele realizować?"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "7Rm1x6"
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Najczęściej zadawane pytania"

#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-faq.tsx
msgctxt "vtHw2p"
msgid "Still have questions? <link>Ask us</link>."
msgstr "Masz jeszcze pytania? <link>Zapytaj nas</link>."

#. The landing's headline: the goals people come with, one per line, then a line for any other goal. Each line must fit on one line of a phone at a very large size, so keep every line as short as {exam} and in the same form: {exam} is the first goal, already written for your country, such as “Passar no concurso” or “共通テスト対策”. Keep the language branches as they are: the page suggests a language other than its own. In Brazilian Portuguese: “<line>{exam}.</line> <line>Falar inglês.</line> <line>Mudar de carreira.</line> <more>Ou o que quiser.</more>”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-headline.tsx
msgctxt "dvqrv8"
msgid "<line>{exam}.</line> <line>{language, select, spanish {Speak Spanish.} other {Speak English.}}</line> <line>Switch careers.</line> <more>Or anything else.</more>"
msgstr "<line>{exam}.</line> <line>{language, select, spanish {Mówić po hiszpańsku.} other {Mówić po angielsku.}}</line> <line>Zmienić zawód.</line> <more>Albo co zechcesz.</more>"

#. The landing's subhead, under a headline listing goals. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Conte seu objetivo e a data. O Zoonk monta um plano para cada dia, do tamanho do seu tempo, começando pelo que você já sabe.”
